        <item>
            <title>3.25.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:43:15 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>228</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.25.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Session search in the sidebar keeps up with typing. It used to stall for about a second on every key with a large session history.
- While searching, the sidebar shows the 100 newest matching closed sessions and a line counting the rest. Keep typing to narrow the search.
- The search index is ready much sooner after launch, so a search right after starting Canopy finds older sessions within a few seconds instead of only the newest 50.
]]></description>
